			subtitle: "Uuhhh.... Ohhh....."
			description: [
				"This is the tricky part"
				"There is 3 types of telescopic devices in Astral sorcery"
				"Looking glass -> Telescope -> Observatory"
				"All of them serve one purpose - get all possible constellations"
				""
				"Follow this steps to unlock your first constellation"
				"1. Craft constellation paper. When you have unlocked \"Exploration\" tree, any first 5-6 constellation papers you touch will be \"readable\" to you"
				"2. Choose constellation you want and check what moon phase it will appear"
				"3. Wait for the moon phase and start looking through your looking glass"
				"4. When you see some strange stars that is kinda on the first plan - you found a constellation. !!! It may be not the constellation you're looking for !!! But you better train yourself on it to understand next steps"
				"5. When you find constellation hold shift and start connectiong stars as it was in constellaton paper"
				"6.If everything done right your constellation paper top black line will change it colour and you can even see this constellation without looking glass"
			]
