			description: [
				"Oh the attunement. It has 2 main uses."
				""
				"Firstly, you need a constellation you want to attune to something"
				"Telescopic tools will help you with that"
				""
				"Once you have your constellation, put it in one hand and get some relays"
				"If your constellation is in the sky this night, little stars on the field will appear."
				"Place relays only in blocks with center of these little stars"
				"Then the attunement altar will start making noise and relays will form the constellation"
				""
				"1."
				"You can throw rock crystal in it and it will attune to that constellation revealing its true powers"
				""
				"2."
				"You can yourself step into attunement altar and attune yourself to specified constellation"
				""
				"This will open you a skill tree that can be modified with astral tome"
